    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[AshCraft: Frontier] is a multiplayer, open-world sandbox survival game that blends voxel-based building, hardcore combat, and strategic raiding. After the apocalypse has turned the world to ash, you must carve out shelter on the resource-scarce wasteland frontier, uncover lost civilizations, stand against hostile forces, and join forces with allies to forge your own \u201cfortress of survival.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a master architect, tactical commander, lone wolf infiltrator, or social powerhouse, you\u2019ll find your place in this frontier world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Voxel-based build &amp; destroy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udd2b Guns, traps &amp; vehicles combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83e\uddf1 Territory control &amp; looting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83c\udf0d Dynamic multiplayer world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udc80 Seasonal wipes &amp; challenges</p>",
